1
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:32,098
?

2
00:01:51,845 --> 00:01:53,847
[ Thunderclaps ]

3
00:01:53,847 --> 00:01:58,051
[ Thunder , Rain Continue ]

4
00:02:05,558 --> 00:02:08,561
[ Thunder Continues ]

5
00:02:08,561 --> 00:02:11,164
[ Gunshots ]

6
00:02:11,698 --> 00:02:14,200
[ Thunder Continues ]

7
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,753
[ Gunshot ]

8
00:02:20,290 --> 00:02:24,794
[ Thunder Continues ]

9
00:02:28,414 --> 00:02:32,418
[ Thunder Continues , Gunshot ]

10
00:02:34,921 --> 00:02:38,424
[ Thunder , Rain Continue ]

11
00:03:26,356 --> 00:03:28,858
WHAT IS THIS ? CHRIST , IT GETS WORSE ALL THE TIME .

12
00:03:28,858 --> 00:03:31,361
THIS JOB DOESN 'T GET ANY BETTER .

13
00:03:31,361 --> 00:03:34,364
ALL SHOT IN THEIR BEDS , EXECUTION STYLE .

14
00:03:34,364 --> 00:03:36,866
ONLY THE MOTHER SHOT IN THE HEAD .

15
00:03:38,368 --> 00:03:41,871
WHAT TIME YOU MAKE IT ? GIVE ME A BALLPARK GUESS .

16
00:03:41,871 --> 00:03:46,376
3 : 00 , 3 : 15 ... AND THAT 'S PRETTY CLOSE .

17
00:03:47,377 --> 00:03:49,379
THANKS .

18
00:04:16,155 --> 00:04:31,254
?

19
00:04:49,272 --> 00:04:51,774
[ Woman ] HOW LONG HAVE YOU BEEN WAITING ?

20
00:04:51,774 --> 00:04:54,277
ABOUT HALF AN HOUR . JUST A COUPLE OF MINUTES .

21
00:04:54,277 --> 00:04:57,780
[ Chuckles ] OVER THERE , THAT 'S A LITTLE GARDENING HUT .

22
00:04:59,282 --> 00:05:00,783
YOU MEAN THAT 'S INCLUDED ? [ Realtor ] SURE .

23
00:05:01,284 --> 00:05:03,286
IT COULD BE A GUEST HOUSE , WITH A LITTLE FIXING UP .

24
00:05:03,286 --> 00:05:05,788
A GUEST HOUSE ? [ Realtor ] SURE .

25
00:05:05,788 --> 00:05:08,791
COME ON . RIGHT UP HERE .

26
00:05:11,294 --> 00:05:13,796
SEE HOW MUCH PROPERTY YOU HAVE ? ISN 'T THAT LOVELY ?

27
00:05:17,917 --> 00:05:19,919
BE CAREFUL . DON 'T TRIP .

28
00:05:21,921 --> 00:05:24,424
YOU 'LL SEE WHAT A BEAUTY THIS IS .

29
00:05:29,062 --> 00:05:32,065
[ Unlocking Door ] THERE 'S NOTHING LIKE IT ON THE MARKET ,

30
00:05:32,065 --> 00:05:34,434
NOT AT THIS PRICE .

31
00:05:37,437 --> 00:05:39,439
COME IN . COME ON IN . THANK YOU .

32
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:41,441
[ Realtor ] IMPRESSIVE , ISN 'T IT ? MM-HMM .

33
00:05:41,441 --> 00:05:44,444
WOW . I MEAN , THAT 'S WHAT I CALL CHARMING .

34
00:05:44,444 --> 00:05:47,447
COME ON , I 'LL SHOW YOU THE LIVING ROOM . OH , THANK YOU .

35
00:05:48,948 --> 00:05:51,951
THAT 'S A WOOD-BURNING FIREPLACE .

36
00:05:51,951 --> 00:05:53,953
OH . BE NICE ON COLD NIGHTS .

37
00:05:56,456 --> 00:05:58,458
HMM .

38
00:05:58,458 --> 00:06:02,462
THAT 'S THE SUNPORCH . NICE , ISN 'T IT ?

39
00:06:02,462 --> 00:06:05,465
[ Softly ] GEORGE , I DON 'T THINK- - [ Softly ] BE COOL .

40
00:06:05,965 --> 00:06:09,469
[ Realtor ] WOULD YOU LIKE TO SEE THE KITCHEN ? [ Woman ] YES , THANK YOU .

41
00:06:09,469 --> 00:06:13,473
THIS IS THE KITCHEN . NICE AND SPACIOUS , ISN 'T IT ? UH-HUH .

42
00:06:13,473 --> 00:06:17,477
REALLY BIG . HAS ALL THE ORIGINAL HARDWARE AND EVERYTHING WORKS .

43
00:06:19,479 --> 00:06:21,981
THIS YOUR FIRST HOUSE ?

44
00:06:21,981 --> 00:06:24,484
UH- - WE JUST GOT MARRIED .

45
00:06:26,486 --> 00:06:28,488
[ Realtor ] SHALL WE LOOK AT THE UPSTAIRS ? [ Wife ] MM-HMM .

46
00:06:28,488 --> 00:06:32,492
I LIKE TO REFER TO THIS AS A FIXER-UPPER THAT CAN BE FUN .

47
00:06:32,492 --> 00:06:36,496
[ Bannister Knob Hits Floor ]

48
00:06:36,496 --> 00:06:40,500
WE CAN START WITH THIS , HUH ? [ Laughs ]

49
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:43,503
NOW , THIS IS AN EXTRA ROOM .

50
00:06:58,651 --> 00:07:01,154
THIS IS THE BATHROOM CONNECTING WITH THE NEXT BEDROOM .

51
00:07:01,154 --> 00:07:04,157
THIS IS THE SECOND BEDROOM .

52
00:07:04,157 --> 00:07:07,160
THERE 'S A NICE VIEW OF THE RIVER FROM HERE .

53
00:07:09,162 --> 00:07:12,665
IF YOU 'RE PLANNING ON A BIG FAMILY , THERE ARE THREE FULL BEDROOMS PLUS- -

54
00:07:12,665 --> 00:07:15,668
WE ALREADY HAVE A FAMILY : TWO BOYS AND A GIRL .

55
00:07:15,668 --> 00:07:18,671
- GREAT KIDS . - OH ?

56
00:07:20,673 --> 00:07:23,176
[ Softly ] YOU ARE SO BAD . WHAT ?

57
00:07:23,176 --> 00:07:25,678
CUT IT OUT . WHAT ?

58
00:07:27,046 --> 00:07:29,048
[ Thunderclap ]

59
00:07:33,803 --> 00:07:35,304
NEXT IS THE MASTER BEDROOM .

60
00:07:50,069 --> 00:07:52,071
I LOVE IT .

61
00:07:53,706 --> 00:07:55,708
THERE 'S JUST ONE MORE FLOOR .

62
00:07:58,711 --> 00:08:02,715
SEE ANYTHING YOU LIKE ... [ Thunderclap ]

63
00:08:06,836 --> 00:08:08,337
WE CAN INCLUDE IT IN THE PRICE .

64
00:08:08,838 --> 00:08:10,840
REALLY ? SURE .

65
00:08:18,347 --> 00:08:22,351
THIS CAN BE ANOTHER BEDROOM , OR A PLAYROOM , WHICHEVER YOU PREFER .

66
00:08:29,609 --> 00:08:33,613
I THINK WE 'LL WANDER AROUND ON OUR OWN AGAIN , NOW THAT WE GOT THE LAYOUT .

67
00:08:33,613 --> 00:08:38,117
WE CAN MEET YOU DOWNSTAIRS . HOW 'D THAT BE ?

68
00:08:38,117 --> 00:08:42,121
I-I 'LL BE IN THE KITCHEN . TAKE YOUR TIME .

69
00:08:42,121 --> 00:08:44,123
WE WON 'T BE LONG .

70
00:08:47,627 --> 00:08:50,630
[ Footsteps Descending Stairs ] WHAT DO YOU THINK ?

71
00:08:51,130 --> 00:08:53,132
I LOVE IT .

72
00:08:54,634 --> 00:08:58,638
BUT , HONEY , $ 80,000 ?

73
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:05,144
[ Sighs ] IT MIGHT AS WELL BE $ 800,000 .

74
00:09:07,146 --> 00:09:10,650
HMM ? WELL , NOW LISTEN .

75
00:09:12,151 --> 00:09:16,155
THE HOUSE IS WORTH 120,000 EASY .

76
00:09:16,155 --> 00:09:18,658
MM-HMM .

77
00:09:18,658 --> 00:09:22,662
IF I MOVE MY OFFICE INTO THAT COTTAGE OUT BACK , THAT 'LL SAVE THAT RENT .

78
00:09:22,662 --> 00:09:27,667
THE BOATHOUSE MEANS I WON 'T HAVE TO SHELL OUT FOR MOORING CHARGES , WHICH THEY 'RE RAISING .

79
00:09:27,667 --> 00:09:30,169
YOU DIDN 'T TELL ME THAT .

80
00:09:30,169 --> 00:09:33,172
THERE WAS NOTHING TO BE DONE ABOUT IT .

81
00:09:33,172 --> 00:09:35,675
I JUST WISH THAT ...

82
00:09:35,675 --> 00:09:38,678
ALL THOSE PEOPLE HADN 'T DIED HERE .

83
00:09:38,678 --> 00:09:42,181
[ Shudders ] A GUY KILLS HIS WHOLE FAMILY ?

84
00:09:42,181 --> 00:09:44,183
DOESN 'T THAT BOTHER YOU ?

85
00:09:44,183 --> 00:09:48,187
YEAH , SURE , BUT HOUSES DON 'T HAVE MEMORIES .

86
00:09:48,688 --> 00:09:50,690
[ Sighs ]

87
00:09:50,690 --> 00:09:53,192
I DON 'T KNOW .

88
00:09:53,192 --> 00:09:55,695
WELL , I DO . THE HOUSE WOULDN 'T EVEN BE FOR SALE .

89
00:09:55,695 --> 00:09:58,197
AND IF IT WAS , WE COULDN 'T AFFORD IT ...

90
00:09:58,197 --> 00:10:02,201
IF WE HAD ... TUNA CASSEROLES FOR A YEAR .

91
00:10:03,586 --> 00:10:07,089
YOU 'RE GOING TO BE VERY HAPPY . IT 'S A WONDERFUL HOUSE .

92
00:10:07,089 --> 00:10:09,091
I 'M SURE THEY 'LL ACCEPT YOUR OFFER .

93
00:10:09,091 --> 00:10:11,711
DON 'T WORRY ABOUT A THING . I 'LL HANDLE THE DETAILS .

94
00:10:11,711 --> 00:10:14,213
JUST GO ON AND GET READY TO MOVE .

95
00:10:16,716 --> 00:10:18,718
[ Door Closes ]

96
00:10:20,219 --> 00:10:23,723
[ Both Laughing ]

97
00:10:23,856 --> 00:10:25,858
[ Beeping ]

98
00:11:07,733 --> 00:11:12,104
[ Unrolling Paper ]

99
00:11:12,104 --> 00:11:14,607
[ Children Laughing ]

100
00:11:14,607 --> 00:11:17,109
THEY 'RE NOT GETTING TOO CLOSE TO THE RIVER OUT THERE ?

101
00:11:17,109 --> 00:11:20,746
UH-UH . SOUNDS LIKE A REGULAR DADDY I HEAR OVER THERE .

102
00:11:20,746 --> 00:11:25,751
I MIGHT FEEL LIKE ONE , IF THAT 'S WHAT THEY STARTED CALLING ME INSTEAD OF GEORGE ,

103
00:11:25,751 --> 00:11:29,755
WHICH , I GOT TO ADMIT , IS BETTER THAN ALL THAT " MR. LUTZ " CRAP THEY WERE GIVING ME .

104
00:11:29,755 --> 00:11:32,758
[ Laughing , Cutting Paper ]

105
00:11:32,758 --> 00:11:36,762
? [ Humming ] WHAT DO YOU WANT TO DO WITH THIS ?

106
00:11:36,762 --> 00:11:38,764
OH , UH- - OH , I KNOW , I KNOW .

107
00:11:39,265 --> 00:11:41,767
PUT IT IN THE LIVING ROOM ON THAT WALL THERE BESIDE THE BOOKSHELF .

108
00:11:41,767 --> 00:11:43,769
THE LIGHT WILL COME THROUGH THE WINDOW AND LOOK BEAUTIFUL .

109
00:11:45,771 --> 00:11:47,773
YOU GOT IT .

110
00:11:59,535 --> 00:12:02,037
VOILA !

111
00:12:02,538 --> 00:12:05,040
AW , SHIT . COME ON .

112
00:12:06,041 --> 00:12:08,043
[ Hammering ]

113
00:12:18,304 --> 00:12:20,306
[ Wife ] OH , I 'M TIRED OF THIS DAMN STICKY PAPER !

114
00:12:20,306 --> 00:12:23,809
I WISH I 'D LISTENED TO MY MOTHER AND GOTTEN THE OLD-FASHIONED KIND THAT YOU TACK DOWN .

115
00:12:23,809 --> 00:12:26,178
NOBODY LIKES A QUITTER .

116
00:12:26,178 --> 00:12:28,180
BUT I GOT AN IDEA .

117
00:12:30,683 --> 00:12:33,569
GET A COUPLE OF BEERS AND GO OUTSIDE AND PLAY ?

118
00:12:36,071 --> 00:12:38,574
WHAT ARE THOSE MONSTERS UP TO ? [ Sighs ]

119
00:12:40,576 --> 00:12:43,078
[ Children Laughing , Chattering ]

120
00:12:43,562 --> 00:12:45,164
[ Tapping ]

121
00:12:45,664 --> 00:12:47,666
[ Tapping Continues ]

122
00:12:52,671 --> 00:12:54,673
HELLO ?

123
00:12:54,924 --> 00:12:57,426
ANYBODY HOME ?

124
00:12:57,927 --> 00:12:59,428
HELLO ?

125
00:13:03,933 --> 00:13:05,935
GEORGE ?

126
00:13:07,436 --> 00:13:09,438
KATHY ?

127
00:13:09,438 --> 00:13:11,941
ANYBODY HOME ?

128
00:13:18,948 --> 00:13:21,450
HELLO ?

129
00:13:21,450 --> 00:13:23,953
[ Children Giggling ]

130
00:13:30,459 --> 00:13:32,962
[ Giggling Continues ]

131
00:13:38,467 --> 00:13:40,469
[ Giggling Continues ]

132
00:13:53,983 --> 00:13:59,438
[ Children Laughing , Chattering In Distance ]

133
00:13:59,438 --> 00:14:03,442
[ Laughing , Chattering Continue ]

134
00:14:11,450 --> 00:14:13,953
[ Laughing , Chattering Continue ]

135
00:14:18,457 --> 00:14:21,961
[ Children Chattering ]

136
00:14:29,969 --> 00:14:34,440
[ Buzzing ]

137
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,892
[ Buzzing Continues ]

138
00:14:54,543 --> 00:14:57,046
[ Children Chattering ]

139
00:14:57,046 --> 00:15:00,416
HARRY , GET OVER HERE .

140
00:15:05,421 --> 00:15:07,423
[ Flies Buzzing ]

141
00:15:12,428 --> 00:15:15,431
[ Buzzing Continues ]

142
00:15:26,325 --> 00:15:29,328
GOD 'S PEACE IN THIS HOUSE .

143
00:15:36,085 --> 00:15:40,089
[ Buzzing Continues ]

144
00:15:42,341 --> 00:15:45,344
[ Buzzing Continues ] [ Coughs ]

145
00:15:45,344 --> 00:15:48,347
[ Buzzing Continues ]

146
00:15:48,347 --> 00:15:52,851
[ Coughing ]

147
00:15:53,352 --> 00:15:55,854
[ Buzzing Continues ]

148
00:16:02,611 --> 00:16:05,481
[ Motor Running ]

149
00:16:18,377 --> 00:16:22,881
[ Buzzing , Loudly ]

150
00:16:22,881 --> 00:16:26,885
[ Buzzing Continues ] [ Coughing ]

151
00:16:26,885 --> 00:16:31,390
[ Continues Coughing ]

152
00:16:41,016 --> 00:16:44,019
[ Buzzing Continues ]

153
00:16:48,023 --> 00:16:50,526
[ Disembodied Voice ] GET OUT .

154
00:16:57,032 --> 00:16:59,535
GET OUT !

155
00:17:15,050 --> 00:17:17,686
[ Coughs ]

156
00:17:32,067 --> 00:17:36,572
[ Retching ]

157
00:17:36,572 --> 00:17:38,824
[ Continues Retching ]

158
00:17:41,326 --> 00:17:46,331
[ Groaning ]

159
00:17:55,891 --> 00:17:59,394
[ Kathy ] AMY ? AMY , HONEY , DINNER 'S READY .

160
00:18:03,348 --> 00:18:05,300
AMY ?

161
00:18:24,336 --> 00:18:27,339
HERE- - NO , I 'VE GOT HER .

162
00:18:27,339 --> 00:18:29,341
YOU AND THE BOYS START . I 'LL TAKE HER UPSTAIRS ...

163
00:18:29,341 --> 00:18:31,343
AND PUT HER TO BED .

164
00:18:37,850 --> 00:18:41,353
[ Boys Running ] SHE WASN 'T OUTSIDE .

165
00:18:41,353 --> 00:18:46,475
WHERE WAS SHE ? BE GETTING IN THERE AND EAT YOUR HOT DOG . WHACK .

166
00:18:59,488 --> 00:19:03,492
[ Line Ringing , Clock Ticking ]

167
00:19:03,492 --> 00:19:06,995
[ Coughs ] [ Line Continues Ringing ]

168
00:19:06,995 --> 00:19:09,498
[ Phone Rings ]

169
00:19:09,498 --> 00:19:13,635
- HELLO . - HELLO- - [ Gags ] HELLO , KATHY ?

170
00:19:13,752 --> 00:19:16,755
[ Static ]

171
00:19:17,256 --> 00:19:21,260
[ Static Continues ] KATHY , CAN YOU HEAR ME ? KATHY ?

172
00:19:24,263 --> 00:19:27,766
FATHER DELANEY . THERE 'S SOMETHING VERY IMPOR- - [ Static Continues ]

173
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:30,903
HELLO ? HELLO ? [ Line Disconnects ]

174
00:20:02,801 --> 00:20:04,803
[ Coughing ]

175
00:20:05,437 --> 00:20:09,942
? [ Kathy Humming ]

176
00:20:10,442 --> 00:20:11,944
WHO WAS THAT ?

177
00:20:12,444 --> 00:20:14,446
ON THE PHONE ? YEAH .

178
00:20:14,446 --> 00:20:17,950
JUST A BUNCH OF STATIC . A BAD CONNECTION OR SOMETHING .

179
00:20:17,950 --> 00:20:20,452
I THINK MA BELL 'S GONE WACKO AGAIN .

180
00:20:22,955 --> 00:20:25,958
PROBABLY DISCOVER IT WAS A COLLECT CALL FROM JAPAN OR SOMEPLACE ...

181
00:20:25,958 --> 00:20:27,960
WHEN THE NEXT BILL COMES .

182
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:31,463
DID YOU MAKE SURE AMY 'S GOT HER DOLL WITH HER ?

183
00:20:31,463 --> 00:20:33,465
YEAH , SHE 'S SLEEPING WITH IT .

184
00:20:33,465 --> 00:20:37,469
YOU HUNGRY , HONEY ? [ Grunts ]

185
00:20:37,469 --> 00:20:41,974
YOU DON 'T WANT ONE OF THOSE CHARBROILED HOT DOGS I DID ESPECIALLY FOR YOU ?

186
00:20:43,475 --> 00:20:45,978
NO , I 'M NOT HUNGRY .

187
00:20:50,482 --> 00:20:53,485
DAMN , IT 'S COLD IN HERE .

188
00:20:53,485 --> 00:20:57,489
I FELT COLD A BIT EARLIER , BUT I THINK I 'VE WARMED UP NOW .

189
00:20:58,490 --> 00:21:01,493
IT SAYS 72 . IT FEELS LIKE 32 .

190
00:21:01,493 --> 00:21:03,495
DO YOU KNOW WHAT I THINK IT IS ?

191
00:21:03,495 --> 00:21:08,000
I THINK THERE 'S A DRAFT THAT COMES UP FROM THE BASEMENT THROUGH THAT DOOR DOWN THERE .

192
00:21:12,004 --> 00:21:14,006
THIS HOUSE IS SUPPOSED TO BE WELL-INSULATED .

193
00:21:14,006 --> 00:21:16,508
THEY 'LL NICKEL-AND-DIME YOU TO DEATH .

194
00:21:16,508 --> 00:21:18,510
HUH ?

195
00:21:20,512 --> 00:21:23,015
[ Footsteps Departing ]

196
00:22:06,224 --> 00:22:09,594
[ Groans ]

197
00:22:09,594 --> 00:22:12,097
MATT ?

198
00:22:12,097 --> 00:22:15,100
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT ? YEAH .

199
00:22:15,100 --> 00:22:18,603
DID YOU HURT YOURSELF ? NO .

200
00:22:18,603 --> 00:22:21,106
THOSE STAIRS ARE TRICKY . COME ON .

201
00:22:21,106 --> 00:22:23,108
I 'LL TAKE YOU UPSTAIRS .

202
00:22:23,108 --> 00:22:25,610
WE 'LL CHECK THIS ALL OUT TOMORROW , HUH ?

203
00:22:27,112 --> 00:22:29,614
[ Grunting ]

204
00:22:33,118 --> 00:22:35,120
[ Sighs ]

205
00:23:06,201 --> 00:23:09,704
[ Gasps ] OH .

206
00:23:09,704 --> 00:23:13,208
I 'M SORRY , BABY . I DIDN 'T MEAN TO SCARE YOU .

207
00:23:13,708 --> 00:23:16,211
I LOOK AT YOU ALL THE TIME .

208
00:23:17,712 --> 00:23:20,215
I CAN 'T GET USED TO YOU .

209
00:23:23,218 --> 00:23:25,220
WHO LOVES YOU ?

210
00:23:29,224 --> 00:23:32,177
- I 'M LUCKY . - COME HERE .

211
00:23:32,677 --> 00:23:35,180
I JUST WANTED TO CLEAN UP FIRST .

212
00:23:42,187 --> 00:23:46,691
[ Sniffs , Kisses ]

213
00:23:46,691 --> 00:23:49,694
I LOVE THE WAY YOU SMELL RIGHT NOW .

214
00:24:00,205 --> 00:24:02,707
[ Softly ] I LOVE YOU .

215
00:24:02,707 --> 00:24:04,709
[ Softly ] I LOVE YOU BACK .

216
00:24:13,301 --> 00:24:16,304
[ Softly ] YOU MAKE ME FEEL LIKE A KID IN THE BACKSEAT OF A CAR .

217
00:24:16,304 --> 00:24:18,807
[ Kathy Chuckling ]

218
00:24:25,313 --> 00:24:28,316
I WANT US TO WORK . I WANT TO BE THE BEST .

219
00:24:28,316 --> 00:24:31,319
I DON 'T WANT YOU TO HAVE ANY REGRETS .

220
00:24:31,319 --> 00:24:33,321
I LOVE YOU , KATHY .

221
00:24:36,324 --> 00:24:40,328
[ Kissing ]

222
00:24:50,839 --> 00:24:53,341
[ Both Laughing ]

223
00:24:55,343 --> 00:24:57,345
[ Moaning ]

224
00:25:21,119 --> 00:25:23,622
[ Moaning Continues ]

225
00:25:28,627 --> 00:25:30,629
[ Hinges Creak ]

226
00:25:32,130 --> 00:25:35,634
I WANT TO GO HOME .

227
00:25:35,634 --> 00:25:37,636
MOMMY , I WANT TO GO HOME .

228
00:25:38,136 --> 00:25:40,138
HONEY , COME ON . WHAT 'S THE TROUBLE ?

229
00:25:40,388 --> 00:25:43,391
COME ON . BACK TO BED .

230
00:25:43,391 --> 00:25:45,894
THIS IS OUR HOME . DON 'T YOU KNOW THAT ?

231
00:25:47,395 --> 00:25:49,397
HERE WE GO .

232
00:25:51,900 --> 00:25:53,902
THERE YOU GO , SWEETIE .

233
00:25:54,402 --> 00:25:56,905
WHAT 'S THE MATTER ? MEAN DREAMS ?

234
00:25:59,908 --> 00:26:01,910
[ Softly ] SLEEP TIGHT .

235
00:26:04,913 --> 00:26:06,915
[ Crickets Chirping ]

236
00:26:07,415 --> 00:26:09,918
[ Chirping Continues ]

237
00:26:41,916 --> 00:26:43,918
IT 'S NOT SO EASY , IS IT ?

238
00:26:45,420 --> 00:26:48,423
WELL , I GUESS PEOPLE HAVE HAD TO DEAL WITH THIS ...

239
00:26:48,423 --> 00:26:52,360
EVER SINCE ADAM AND EVE GOT KICKED OUT OF THE GARDEN .

240
00:26:53,895 --> 00:26:55,880
I 'LL JUST HAVE TO LEARN TO LIVE WITH IT .

241
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:57,882
HMM ?

242
00:27:01,386 --> 00:27:03,388
[ Softly ] THANK YOU .

243
00:27:42,744 --> 00:27:44,546
[ Rustling ]

