I DON 'T LIKE LECTURES ,

481
00:50:19,082 --> 00:50:22,085
AND I DON 'T LIKE BEING HASSLED IN THE MEN 'S ROOM .

482
00:50:22,085 --> 00:50:24,588
I 'M GONNA WRITE YOU A CHECK .

483
00:50:24,588 --> 00:50:26,590
EITHER THAT 'S GOOD ENOUGH FOR YOU ...

484
00:50:26,590 --> 00:50:29,092
OR YOU 'RE GONNA EAT YOUR OWN GODDAMN FOOD .

485
00:50:31,094 --> 00:50:33,096
LOOK AT THIS .

486
00:50:33,096 --> 00:50:37,100
I WANT CASH , AND THEY 'RE GIVING ME A CHECK .

487
00:50:37,100 --> 00:50:39,102
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT , HONEY ?

488
00:50:39,102 --> 00:50:42,105
I DON 'T THINK I CAN MAKE IT THROUGH THE RECEPTION .

489
00:50:42,105 --> 00:50:44,107
LET 'S GET THE KIDS AND SPLIT , HUH ?

490
00:50:44,107 --> 00:50:47,611
I 'LL GET THE KIDS . YOU TAKE IT EASY .

491
00:50:47,611 --> 00:50:52,616
? [ Continues ]

492
00:50:52,616 --> 00:50:58,488
?

493
00:51:02,743 --> 00:51:04,745
[ Turns Off Engine ]

494
00:51:14,755 --> 00:51:16,757
[ Grunts ]

495
00:51:19,760 --> 00:51:22,262
MATT , GET OVER HERE .

496
00:51:27,768 --> 00:51:30,270
MATT , RIGHT UPSTAIRS AND RIGHT TO BED . COME ON . WHY ?

497
00:51:30,270 --> 00:51:32,272
UPSTAIRS AND RIGHT TO BED . I 'M NOT EVEN TIRED .

498
00:51:32,272 --> 00:51:34,274
YOU ARE SO TIRED . I AM NOT !

499
00:51:34,274 --> 00:51:36,276
YOU 'RE TIRED BECAUSE I SAID YOU 'RE TIRED . [ Scoffs ]

500
00:51:36,276 --> 00:51:38,278
HEY , CUT THAT OUT .

501
00:51:38,278 --> 00:51:40,280
I 'LL BRING YOU UP SOME MILK AND COOKIES .

502
00:51:40,280 --> 00:51:43,834
[ Crying ] LET ME OUT .

503
00:51:43,950 --> 00:51:45,952
[ Continues Crying ] LET ME OUT .

504
00:51:45,952 --> 00:51:50,457
LET ME OUT . [ Kathy ] AMY ? AMY , ARE YOU OKAY ?

505
00:51:50,457 --> 00:51:52,459
LET ME OUT .

506
00:51:52,959 --> 00:51:55,962
[ Crying ] JACKIE ?

507
00:51:55,962 --> 00:51:59,466
OH , MY GOD ! WHAT HAPPENED ? I-I COULDN 'T GET OUT .

508
00:51:59,466 --> 00:52:02,469
THE DOOR CLOSED , AND IT LOCKED , AND I COULDN 'T GET OUT .

509
00:52:02,469 --> 00:52:04,471
THERE 'S NO LOCK ON THIS DOOR .

510
00:52:04,471 --> 00:52:06,473
IT WOULDN 'T OPEN . TAKE A LOOK .

511
00:52:06,973 --> 00:52:08,475
LOOK . SEE ?

512
00:52:10,644 --> 00:52:13,146
IT WOULDN 'T OPEN !

513
00:52:13,146 --> 00:52:16,149
WHY DIDN 'T YOU OPEN THE DOOR ? WHY DIDN 'T YOU ANSWER ME ? JACKIE ! JACKIE ! JACKIE !

514
00:52:16,399 --> 00:52:20,403
WHY DIDN 'T YOU UNLOCK THE DOOR ? YOU HEARD JACKIE KNOCKING .

515
00:52:20,904 --> 00:52:24,908
- JODY WOULDN 'T LET ME . - [ George ] WHO 'S JODY ?

516
00:52:24,908 --> 00:52:27,911
SHE 'S MY FRIEND , AND SHE COMES TO PLAY WITH ME .

517
00:52:27,911 --> 00:52:31,414
JESUS CHRIST , WHAT THE HELL ARE WE STANDING HERE LISTENING TO ?

518
00:52:31,915 --> 00:52:33,416
AND WEREN 'T YOU TOLD TO GO TO BED ?

519
00:52:33,917 --> 00:52:36,419
GO ON ! GET OUT OF HERE !

520
00:52:36,920 --> 00:52:38,922
[ Crying Softly ]

521
00:52:39,422 --> 00:52:41,424
THESE KIDS OF YOURS NEED SOME GODDAMN DISCIPLINE .

522
00:52:41,424 --> 00:52:44,895
[ Footsteps Departing ]

523
00:52:44,895 --> 00:52:46,897
LET ME SEE .

524
00:52:46,897 --> 00:52:50,400
LET ME GO GET SOMETHING FOR THEM . GEORGE YELLED AT ME .

525
00:52:50,400 --> 00:52:51,902
YOU SHOULD HAVE OPENED THE DOOR !

526
00:52:53,403 --> 00:52:56,890
JODY DOESN 'T LIKE GEORGE .

527
00:53:40,150 --> 00:53:43,653
[ George Yells ] WHERE THE HELL IS IT ?

528
00:53:47,157 --> 00:53:50,577
[ Man ] THERE 'S AN EXPLANATION FOR ALL OF IT .

529
00:53:50,710 --> 00:53:53,713
WE 'RE NOT IN THE HABIT OF BLAMING SATAN FOR EVERY PHENOMENON .

530
00:53:53,713 --> 00:53:57,217
NEITHER AM I , FATHER .

531
00:53:57,217 --> 00:53:59,719
FOR A MARIANIST WHO THOUGHT VATICAN II DIDN 'T GO FAR ENOUGH ,

532
00:53:59,719 --> 00:54:02,222
DON 'T YOU THINK YOU SOUND A LITTLE MEDIEVAL ?

533
00:54:04,341 --> 00:54:07,344
[ Sighs ] MY BEING A MARIANIST HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH IT .

534
00:54:07,477 --> 00:54:09,479
I HAPPENED TO CHECK INTO THE MURDERS .

535
00:54:09,479 --> 00:54:13,483
I CHECKED INTO THE 20-YEAR-OLD BOY WHO KILLED HIS PARENTS AND HIS FOUR BROTHERS AND SISTERS .

536
00:54:13,483 --> 00:54:16,987
WHEN HE WAS AT TRIAL , HE TESTIFIED HE HEARD VOICES IN THE HOUSE !

537
00:54:17,487 --> 00:54:20,991
HE HEARD VOICES IN THE HOUSE AND THE VOICES TOLD HIM TO DO IT !

538
00:54:20,991 --> 00:54:23,493
NOW , I WAS IN THE HOUSE , AND I HEARD THE VOICES TOO !

539
00:54:23,493 --> 00:54:26,029
I ALSO FELT A PRESENCE IN THE HOUSE !

540
00:54:26,029 --> 00:54:28,531
I 'M TELLING YOU , THERE WAS A PRESENCE IN THAT HOUSE !

541
00:54:28,531 --> 00:54:31,534
HALF THE KILLERS IN THIS COUNTRY SAY THE SAME THING .

542
00:54:32,035 --> 00:54:35,038
" THE VOICES . THE VOICES TOLD ME TO DO IT . "

543
00:54:35,038 --> 00:54:38,541
BUT I HEARD THEM , FATHER ! I HEARD VOICES !

544
00:54:38,541 --> 00:54:41,544
THEN EXPLAIN THIS ! EXPLAIN MY HAND , IF YOU CAN DO THAT !

545
00:54:41,928 --> 00:54:44,881
GO ON ! EXPLAIN HOW THE CAR WENT OUT OF CONTROL !

546
00:54:45,265 --> 00:54:48,268
FATHER BOLEN WAS WITH ME . YOU TELL THEM !

547
00:54:48,268 --> 00:54:50,270
WELL , THE WHEEL LOCKED AND THEN THE- -

548
00:54:50,770 --> 00:54:55,275
THE WHEEL LOCKED . HOW ABOUT A MECHANICAL DEFECT ?

549
00:54:55,275 --> 00:54:58,778
I 'D BLAME DETROIT A LOT FASTER THAN THE DEVIL .

550
00:54:58,778 --> 00:55:02,282
SEEMS LIKE EVERY MONTH THERE 'S SOME KIND OF RECALL .

551
00:55:03,283 --> 00:55:08,288
OH ... I SEE .

552
00:55:08,288 --> 00:55:11,791
[ Laughs ] WE 'RE JUST GONNA WALK AWAY FROM IT .

553
00:55:11,791 --> 00:55:14,294
HAS THAT BECOME THE FASHION NOW , TO COVER UP ?

554
00:55:14,294 --> 00:55:17,280
NOTHING TO WALK AWAY FROM .

555
00:55:17,280 --> 00:55:20,216
I THINK IT 'S NONSENSE . THERE 'S NOTHING TO COVER UP .

556
00:55:20,216 --> 00:55:24,087
I THINK IT 'S BUREAUCRATICAL BULLSHIT !

557
00:55:25,005 --> 00:55:27,007
WHAT DO YOU THINK I AM ?

558
00:55:28,258 --> 00:55:30,260
I AM NOT SOME ...

559
00:55:30,260 --> 00:55:33,763
PINK-CHEEKED SEMINARIAN WHO DOESN 'T KNOW THE DIFFERENCE ...

560
00:55:33,763 --> 00:55:36,766
BETWEEN THE SUPERNATURAL AND A BAD CLAM !

561
00:55:37,017 --> 00:55:40,520
I AM A TRAINED PSYCHOTHERAPIST ! I WENT INTO THAT HOUSE !

562
00:55:40,520 --> 00:55:44,524
WHAT I SAW THERE WAS REAL , WHAT I FELT THERE WAS REAL ...

563
00:55:44,524 --> 00:55:46,526
AND WHAT I HEARD THERE WAS REAL !

564
00:55:47,027 --> 00:55:51,031
NOW , GENTLEMEN , I HAVE A FAMILY IN MY PARISH THAT 'S AT GREAT RISK !

565
00:55:51,031 --> 00:55:53,917
THEY ARE FACING REAL DANGER .

566
00:55:55,418 --> 00:55:58,421
WHO THE HELL DO YOU THINK YOU ARE ?

567
00:55:58,788 --> 00:56:03,793
YOU THINK YOUR SECULAR EDUCATION GIVES YOU THE RIGHT TO QUESTION THE CHURCH ?

568
00:56:03,793 --> 00:56:05,795
SIT DOWN !

569
00:56:07,797 --> 00:56:09,299
SIT !

570
00:56:21,694 --> 00:56:24,697
NOW , YOU HAVEN 'T TOLD US ONE THING ...

571
00:56:24,697 --> 00:56:28,701
THAT CAN 'T BE WRITTEN OFF AS SIMPLE HYSTERIA .

572
00:56:28,701 --> 00:56:33,206
EVEN PSYCHOTHERAPISTS LOSE TOUCH WITH REALITY SOMETIMES .

573
00:56:33,206 --> 00:56:37,210
YOUR EDUCATION DOESN 'T GIVE YOU ANY IMMUNITY .

574
00:56:39,712 --> 00:56:43,216
FATHER NUNCIO AND I HAVE SEEN OUR SHARE OF PHENOMENA ,

575
00:56:43,216 --> 00:56:47,720
AND NEVER ONCE DID ANY OF THEM TURN OUT TO BE SATANIST !

576
00:56:52,225 --> 00:56:55,728
LET 'S UNDERSTAND EACH OTHER , FATHER .

577
00:56:58,231 --> 00:57:01,234
TO ME ... THE CHURCH- -

578
00:57:01,234 --> 00:57:04,000
IT 'S MY HOME .

579
00:57:4,154 --> 00:57:6,656
THE CHURCH ...

580
00:57:6,656 --> 00:57:10,160
IS MY STRENGTH .

581
00:57:16,166 --> 00:57:18,668
AND I NEED HER NOW .

582
00:57:18,668 --> 00:57:21,087
AND THAT FAMILY ...

583
00:57:21,588 --> 00:57:23,590
NEEDS HER ...

584
00:57:23,590 --> 00:57:25,592
NOW .

585
00:57:30,597 --> 00:57:35,602
FRANK ... HOW LONG HAS IT BEEN SINCE YOU 'VE SEEN YOUR FAMILY ?

586
00:57:40,223 --> 00:57:42,225
WHAT DO YOU MEAN ?

587
00:57:42,225 --> 00:57:44,727
WE THINK YOU SHOULD TAKE A VACATION .

588
00:57:49,232 --> 00:57:51,234
[ Bolen ] GOOD MORNING , FATHER .

589
00:57:51,234 --> 00:57:53,736
GOOD DAY , FATHER .

590
00:57:55,238 --> 00:57:57,740
YOU COULD DO WITH A HAIRCUT AND SHAVE .

591
00:57:57,740 --> 00:58:3,746
[ Bell Tolling ]

592
00:58:28,402 --> 00:58:32,907
[ Chopping Continues ]

593
00:58:39,413 --> 00:58:42,416
WHAT DO YOU THINK ? VERY UPTOWN .

594
00:58:42,416 --> 00:58:44,418
I THOUGHT YOU GUYS HAD A SMALL BUSINESS . BELIEVE ME , WE DO .

595
00:58:44,418 --> 00:58:47,421
GETTING SMALLER ALL THE TIME .

596
00:58:47,421 --> 00:58:49,423
WHAT 'S THE MATTER ?

597
00:58:53,427 --> 00:58:55,930
I DON 'T WANT TO GO ANY CLOSER .

598
00:58:55,930 --> 00:58:59,433
CAROLYN , WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT ?

599
00:59:0,935 --> 00:59:3,437
IT GIVES ME THE CREEPS .

600
00:59:6,440 --> 00:59:7,942
[ Scoffs ]

601
00:59:14,448 --> 00:59:18,953
[ Scraping ]

602
00:59:24,458 --> 00:59:27,461
HIYA , GEORGE . HOW 'S IT GOING ?

603
00:59:30,464 --> 00:59:35,469
LISTEN , I WOULDN 'T HAVE COME OUT AND BOTHERED YOU , BUT YOUR LINE 'S ALWAYS BUSY .

604
00:59:35,469 --> 00:59:38,472
NOBODY 'S SEEN YOU FOR DAYS .

605
00:59:38,589 --> 00:59:40,090
[ Continues Sharpening Axe ]

606
00:59:40,591 --> 00:59:43,093
YOU HAVEN 'T EVEN BEEN IN TO SIGN THE PAYROLL CHECKS .

607
00:59:43,093 --> 00:59:45,596
I DID US BOTH A FAVOR AND BROUGHT THEM ALONG .

608
00:59:45,980 --> 00:59:47,481
HERE .

609
00:59:47,982 --> 00:59:49,984
- WHAT DAY IS THIS ? - THURSDAY .

610
00:59:52,486 --> 00:59:54,989
THURSDAY ?

611
00:59:54,989 --> 00:59:57,491
THURSDAY .

612
00:59:57,858 --> 01:00:1,862
I PROMISED THE MEN I 'D HAND DELIVER THESE .

613
01:00:2,363 --> 01:00:3,864
SHOULD HAVE BEEN PAID YESTERDAY .

614
01:00:6,367 --> 01:00:10,871
SOME CATERER 'S BEEN SCREAMING YOU WROTE HIM A PERSONAL CHECK THAT BOUNCED .

615
01:00:12,873 --> 01:00:14,875
I SHOULD HAVE COVERED THAT .

616
01:00:14,875 --> 01:00:17,378
AND SOME GUY FROM THE I.R.S. HAS BEEN CALLING .

617
01:00:17,378 --> 01:00:20,381
DON 'T YOU HAVE ANY GOOD NEWS ?

618
01:00:23,884 --> 01:00:29,390
YEAH , I- - I BROUGHT YOU THE SPOTLIGHT FOR YOUR BOAT .

619
01:00:32,393 --> 01:00:34,395
OH .

620
01:00:34,395 --> 01:00:38,399
COME ON . I 'LL PUT IT ON FOR YOU .

621
01:00:41,285 --> 01:00:43,287
COME ON .

622
01:00:57,668 --> 01:01:0,671
[ Amy ] YOU GIRLS THINK I DON 'T KNOW WHAT YOU 'RE UP TO ?

623
01:01:0,804 --> 01:01:5,809
WELL , I DO , AND IF I EVER CATCH YOU AGAIN ,

624
01:01:5,809 --> 01:01:8,312
YOU 'RE GONNA BE IN BIG TROUBLE .

625
01:01:8,312 --> 01:01:12,683
YOU GIRLS HEAR ME ? JANET , ARE YOU LISTENING ?

626
01:01:12,683 --> 01:01:14,818
NOW , DON 'T BE A SMART-ASS .

627
01:01:18,322 --> 01:01:21,825
YOU QUIT THAT . STOP TEASING ME .

628
01:01:24,828 --> 01:01:28,832
HEY , WHAT ARE YOU TWO RASCALS DOING IN MY ROOM , HUH ?

629
01:01:29,333 --> 01:01:32,703
[ Screaming ]

630
01:01:33,203 --> 01:01:36,707
[ Screaming Continues ]

631
01:01:37,091 --> 01:01:40,094
[ Continues Screaming , Crying ] [ Kathy ] OH , MY GOD !

632
01:01:42,096 --> 01:01:46,967
[ Continues Crying ]

633
01:01:46,967 --> 01:01:50,471
THE GODDAMN THING FEELS LIKE IT 'S NAILED SHUT !

634
01:01:50,471 --> 01:01:55,976
- [ Straining ] - [ Kathy ] PUSH !

635
01:01:58,612 --> 01:02:4,118
[ Siren Approaching Slowly ]

636
01:02:4,618 --> 01:02:10,124
[ Siren Continues ]

637
01:02:10,124 --> 01:02:16,130
[ Siren Winding Down ]

638
01:02:21,635 --> 01:02:23,637
HOLD IT OUT . DON 'T LET IT DROP .

639
01:02:23,637 --> 01:02:25,639
I 'LL DRIVE , HONEY .

640
01:02:25,639 --> 01:02:27,641
AMAZING . WHAT ?

641
01:02:27,641 --> 01:02:30,144
NOT ONE BROKEN BONE .

642
01:02:30,644 --> 01:02:34,598
[ Thunderclaps , Rumbling ]

643
01:02:34,598 --> 01:02:39,820
[ Thunder Continues ]

644
01:02:39,820 --> 01:02:42,372
GEORGE , ARE YOU AWAKE ?

645
01:02:46,243 --> 01:02:50,364
ISN 'T IT KIND OF STRANGE NONE OF THE BONES WERE BROKEN IN GREG 'S HAND ?

646
01:02:54,668 --> 01:02:57,254
GEORGE , I HAVE TO TALK TO YOU .

647
01:02:57,254 --> 01:03:3,043
[ Thunder Continues Rumbling ]

648
01:03:27,601 --> 01:03:31,622
[ Fly Buzzing ]

649
01:04:22,005 --> 01:04:27,794
[ Fly Buzzing ]

650
01:04:27,794 --> 01:04:33,016
[ Buzzing Continues ]

651
01:04:34,518 --> 01:04:36,520
[ Flies Buzzing ]

652
01:04:36,520 --> 01:04:42,025
[ Buzzing Continues ]

653
01:05:3,046 --> 01:05:8,085
[ Creaking ]

654
01:05:8,085 --> 01:05:11,588
[ Buzzing Continues ]

655
01:05:12,706 --> 01:05:14,841
[ Thunderclap ]

656
01:05:19,346 --> 01:05:21,848
WHAT WAS THAT ? I DON 'T KNOW . YOU STAY UP HERE .

657
01:05:21,848 --> 01:05:24,351
LIKE HELL .

658
01:05:31,825 --> 01:05:33,827
WAIT .

659
01:05:46,340 --> 01:05:49,343
[ Sighs ] DON 'T SNEAK UP ON ME !

660
01:05:49,343 --> 01:05:51,845
YOU CALL THE POLICE .

661
01:05:51,845 --> 01:05:55,849
I 'M GOING TO GO CHECK ON SOMETHING . COME HERE , SWEETIE .

662
01:06:32,469 --> 01:06:37,974
[ Police Radio Transmissions , Indistinct ]

663
01:06:38,475 --> 01:06:43,347
[ Radio Transmissions Continue ]

664
01:06:44,348 --> 01:06:46,350
[ Closes Car Door ]

665
01:06:52,406 --> 01:06:54,908
HI , SARGE . WHAT BRINGS YOU OUT ?

666
01:06:54,908 --> 01:06:56,910
INSOMNIA .

667
01:07:4,418 --> 01:07:7,921
WHAT DO YOU GOT ? BEATS THE HELL OUT OF ME .

668
01:07:13,043 --> 01:07:16,012
[ Car Door Closes , Engine Starts ]

669
01:07:16,012 --> 01:07:21,518
[ Car Departing ]

670
01:07:25,939 --> 01:07:29,443
WHAT DO YOU GOT ? THIS IS MRS. LUTZ , SERGEANT .

671
01:07:29,443 --> 01:07:31,945
MRS. LUTZ . [ Mumbles ]

672
01:07:31,945 --> 01:07:34,448
AND GEORGE LUTZ .

673
01:07:41,955 --> 01:07:43,457
IS THAT L-U-T-Z-E ?

674
01:07:43,957 --> 01:07:45,358
NO " E. "

675
01:07:45,358 --> 01:07:48,395
THE BASEMENT DOOR IS THE SAME AS THE FRONT .

676
01:07:49,579 --> 01:07:51,131
WHERE 'S THE BASEMENT ?

677
01:07:51,631 --> 01:07:53,633
COME ON , I 'LL SHOW YOU .

678
01:08:11,101 --> 01:08:15,105
[ Harry Whimpering ]

679
01:08:15,105 --> 01:08:17,107
[ Whimpering Continues ] [ George ] HEY , WHO LET YOU IN ?

680
01:08:17,107 --> 01:08:20,610
WHAT ARE YOU DOING THERE , BOY ?

681
01:08:25,615 --> 01:08:28,618
[ Whining ] NO BROKEN WINDOWS .

682
01:08:31,121 --> 01:08:33,123
HOW LONG YOU BEEN LIVING HERE ?

683
01:08:33,123 --> 01:08:35,625
A COUPLE OF WEEKS .

684
01:08:35,625 --> 01:08:39,629
ARE YOU RELATED TO THE FAMILY THAT WAS HERE BEFORE ?

685
01:08:39,629 --> 01:08:42,182
UH-UH . [ Harry Scratching ]

686
01:08:42,182 --> 01:08:44,184
YOU LOOK A LOT LIKE THEM .

687
01:08:44,684 --> 01:08:46,686
[ Whining , Scratching ] THE KID HAD THE SAME- -

688
01:08:46,686 --> 01:08:49,189
HARRY , KNOCK IT OFF !

689
01:08:55,645 --> 01:08:57,647
[ Growling ]

690
01:08:57,647 --> 01:09:1,651
HAVE YOU HAD ANY TROUBLE WITH VANDALS OR TRESPASSERS ?

691
01:09:1,651 --> 01:09:4,154
WHAT 'S THAT SUPPOSED TO MEAN ?

692
01:09:4,154 --> 01:09:6,156
[ Clears Throat ]

693
01:09:6,156 --> 01:09:11,161
YOU 'VE GOT A DOOR THAT WAS BROKEN OUTWARD FROM THE INSIDE .

694
01:09:11,161 --> 01:09:13,163
BURGLARS BREAK IN .

695
01:09:13,163 --> 01:09:15,665
YOU 'VE GOT A FRONT DOOR THAT 'S BROKEN OUT .

696
01:09:15,665 --> 01:09:19,669
LET ME TELL YOU SOMETHING . SOMEBODY BROKE INTO MY HOUSE .

697
01:09:20,170 --> 01:09:22,088
THEY HEARD ME COMING , AND THEY TOOK OFF .

698
01:09:22,622 --> 01:09:25,642
UH-HUH . OKAY . THEN WHO BROKE THE BASEMENT DOOR ?

699
01:09:25,642 --> 01:09:28,144
MAYBE THEY CAME IN THROUGH THE CELLAR ...

700
01:09:28,645 --> 01:09:31,264
AND THEN RAN OUT THE FRONT DOOR .

701
01:09:31,765 --> 01:09:34,267
I CHECKED ALL THE WINDOWS DOWN THERE . NONE BROKEN .

702
01:09:34,267 --> 01:09:37,771
YOU THINK IT WAS FASTER TO BREAK IT DOWN THAN TO OPEN IT ?

703
01:09:44,578 --> 01:09:48,081
THERE 'LL BE A TIGHTER WATCH ON YOUR HOUSE .

704
01:09:48,081 --> 01:09:51,585
YOU CALL US IF ANYTHING HAPPENS , OKAY ?

705
01:09:51,585 --> 01:09:56,089
OKAY . GOOD NIGHT . GOOD NIGHT .

706
01:09:56,089 --> 01:09:58,041
GOOD NIGHT .

707
01:10:2,462 --> 01:10:5,966
[ Car Door Closes , Engine Starts ]

708
01:10:5,966 --> 01:10:11,471
[ Car Departing ]

709
01:10:36,997 --> 01:10:41,001
[ Crying ]

710
01:10:43,003 --> 01:10:48,508
[ Continues Crying ]

711
01:10:48,508 --> 01:10:52,012
[ Sighs ]

712
01:10:56,016 --> 01:10:59,519
WHY IS THIS ALL GOING WRONG ?

713
01:10:59,519 --> 01:11:3,023
WE HAVE TO DO SOMETHING .

714
01:11:26,680 --> 01:11:28,682
[ Amy ] JODY SAYS EVERYTHING 'S GONNA GET BETTER .

715
01:11:29,049 --> 01:11:31,551
MM-HMM . WHAT DOES JODY LOOK LIKE ?

716
01:11:33,053 --> 01:11:35,555
I MEAN , UH ... IS JODY ...

717
01:11:35,555 --> 01:11:39,059
BIG OR THIN OR FAT ?

718
01:11:39,059 --> 01:11:42,562
SHE 'S NICE . MM-HMM .

719
01:11:42,562 --> 01:11:46,066
SHE TELLS ME THINGS TOO . YEAH ? LIKE WHAT DOES SHE TELL YOU ?

720
01:11:46,066 --> 01:11:50,070
SHE TELLS ME ABOUT THE LITTLE BOY WHO USED TO LIVE IN MY ROOM .

721
01:11:50,070 --> 01:11:53,073
HE GOT HURT , AND HE DIED .

722
01:11:54,074 --> 01:11:56,076
WHAT ELSE DOES JODY TELL YOU ?

723
01:11:56,076 --> 01:11:59,579
SHE SAYS SHE WANTS ME TO LIVE HERE FOREVER AND EVER ,

724
01:11:59,579 --> 01:12:3,333
SO WE CAN ALL PLAY TOGETHER .

725
01:12:4,834 --> 01:12:6,836
[ Harry Barks ]

726
01:12:7,337 --> 01:12:9,839
[ Starts Engine ]

727
01:12:15,228 --> 01:12:18,732
[ Barking ]

728
01:12:24,237 --> 01:12:28,742
GOOD-BYE , SWEETIES . BE HOME BY 3 : 30 , OKAY ?

729
01:12:28,742 --> 01:12:30,744
BE CAREFUL .

730
01:13:10,784 --> 01:13:15,288
[ Whispering , Indistinct ]

731
01:13:34,758 --> 01:13:39,763
[ Line Ringing ]

732
01:13:40,764 --> 01:13:44,734
[ Continues Ringing ]

733
01:13:44,734 --> 01:13:46,736
OH , ANSWER .

734
01:13:46,736 --> 01:13:50,240
[ Rings ]

735
01:13:50,240 --> 01:13:55,745
[ Continues Ringing ]

736
01:13:57,113 --> 01:14:2,118
[ Continues Ringing ] PLEASE ANSWER .

737
01:14:2,619 --> 01:14:7,624
[ Continues Ringing ]

738
01:14:8,758 --> 01:14:13,263
[ Continues Ringing ]

739
01:14:14,264 --> 01:14:16,266
HELLO .

740
01:14:16,266 --> 01:14:20,770
FATHER , THIS IS KATHY LUTZ , AND I HAVE TO TALK TO YOU .

741
01:14:20,770 --> 01:14:25,775
KATHY ... LISTEN TO WHAT I 'M TELLING YOU .

742
01:14:25,775 --> 01:14:30,280
[ Static ] FATHER ? FATHER ?

743
01:14:30,280 --> 01:14:34,784
[ Static Continues ]

744
01:14:34,784 --> 01:14:37,287
FATHER !

745
01:14:38,788 --> 01:14:42,792
[ Dial Tone ]

746
01:14:42,792 --> 01:14:44,794
[ Drops Receiver ]

747
01:14:44,794 --> 01:14:48,298
[ Gasping ]

748
01:14:49,299 --> 01:14:52,802
O , LORD , HEAR MY PRAYER ...

749
01:14:52,802 --> 01:14:55,305
AND HASTEN TO ANSWER ME .

750
01:15:20,330 --> 01:15:24,334
[ Scratching ]

751
01:15:25,335 --> 01:15:30,340
[ Thumping , Scratching ]

752
01:15:31,341 --> 01:15:34,344
[ Knocking , Scratching ]

753
01:15:37,347 --> 01:15:43,353
HELLO . EVERYBODY WANTED TO COME OVER TO WELCOME YOU TO THE NEIGHBORHOOD .

754
01:15:45,855 --> 01:15:47,857
IT 'S ALL RIGHT , ISN 'T IT ?

755
01:15:48,224 --> 01:15:51,227
[ Phone Rings ]

756
01:15:51,227 --> 01:15:56,232
JUST A MINUTE , PLEASE . [ Ringing Continues ]

757
01:15:56,232 --> 01:15:59,235
HELLO . [ Static ]

758
01:15:59,235 --> 01:16:1,738
HELLO ? [ Line Disconnects ]

759
01:16:29,482 --> 01:16:31,484
[ Revs Engine ]

760
01:16:31,484 --> 01:16:33,486
[ Turns Off Engine ]

761
01:16:38,992 --> 01:16:42,495
[ Men Laughing ]

762
01:16:49,002 --> 01:16:53,006
GEORGE ... THANKS FOR COMING .

763
01:16:53,506 --> 01:16:55,508
I THOUGHT I MIGHT BE STOOD UP .

764
01:16:55,508 --> 01:16:58,011
LOOK , DON 'T GIVE ME ANY CRAP . I DON 'T HAVE TIME .

765
01:16:58,011 --> 01:17:2,015
GEORGE , RELAX , WILL YOU ? I JUST WANT TO BUY YOU A DRINK .

766
01:17:2,015 --> 01:17:5,018
A COUPLE OF BEERS , PLEASE ? [ Bartender ] GOTCHA .

767
01:17:8,521 --> 01:17:11,524
GEORGE ... ARE YOU ALL RIGHT ?

768
01:17:11,524 --> 01:17:13,526
I MEAN , YOU LOOK TERRIBLE .

769
01:17:13,526 --> 01:17:15,528
HERE YOU ARE , PAL .

770
01:17:16,029 --> 01:17:18,031
JESUS , I 'M SORRY .

771
01:17:18,031 --> 01:17:20,483
YOU LOOK JUST LIKE THAT KID .

772
01:17:20,483 --> 01:17:23,519
YOU KNOW , HE WAS SITTING RIGHT IN THAT SEAT WHERE YOU ARE WHEN HE WAS ARRESTED .

773
01:17:23,519 --> 01:17:25,021
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT ?

774
01:17:25,021 --> 01:17:27,540
THE KID LAST YEAR THAT KILLED HIS FAMILY .

775
01:17:27,540 --> 01:17:29,042
THE HOUSE DOWN BY THE RIVER ?

776
01:17:29,042 --> 01:17:32,545
YOU 'RE THE SPITTING IMAGE . SO ?

777
01:17:33,046 --> 01:17:36,549
SO I 'LL BRING YOU ANOTHER BREW . NO OFFENSE , HUH ?

778
01:17:38,551 --> 01:17:41,554
LOOK , I GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE . I 'LL TALK TO YOU LATER .

779
01:17:41,554 --> 01:17:45,558
NO , WE GOTTA TALK NOW . THE BUSINESS IS FALLING APART .

780
01:17:46,059 --> 01:17:48,061
PEOPLE ARE CALLING . BILLS HAVE TO BE PAID .

781
01:17:48,061 --> 01:17:50,063
I KNOW YOU 'RE BUSY UNPACKING , BUT LIFE GOES ON .

782
01:17:50,063 --> 01:17:52,565
DON 'T PUSH ME , JEFF . I 'M WARNING YOU . I DON 'T HAVE THE PATIENCE .

783
01:17:53,066 --> 01:17:56,569
YOU 'RE WARNING ME ? GIVE ME A BREAK . TALK TO ME !

784
01:17:59,572 --> 01:18:3,076
I KNEW THIS WOULD HAPPEN . I TOLD YOU YOU WERE TAKING ON TOO MUCH .

785
01:18:3,076 --> 01:18:5,578
JUST DROP IT , JEFF ! YOU MARRY A DAME WITH THREE KIDS ,

786
01:18:5,578 --> 01:18:8,081
YOU BUY A BIG HOUSE WITH MORTGAGES UP TO YOUR ASS ,

787
01:18:8,081 --> 01:18:10,583
YOU CHANGE YOUR RELIGION AND YOU FORGET ABOUT BUSINESS ,

788
01:18:10,583 --> 01:18:13,086
REALLY GREAT . [ Slaps Jeff ]

789
01:18:19,592 --> 01:18:23,096
OKAY . NOW CAN WE TALK ?

790
01:18:26,099 --> 01:18:30,103
CHRIST , MAN , I 'M SORRY . I DON 'T KNOW WHAT I WAS THINKING .

791
01:18:30,103 --> 01:18:32,605
ALL RIGHT .

792
01:18:33,106 --> 01:18:38,444
[ Amy ] ? JESUS LOVES ME THIS I KNOW ?

793
01:18:38,444 --> 01:18:43,199
? FOR THE BIBLE TELLS ME SO ?

794
01:18:43,199 --> 01:18:47,820
? LITTLE ONES TO HIM BELONG ?

795
01:18:47,820 --> 01:18:53,459
? THEY ARE WEAK BUT HE IS STRONG ?

796
01:18:53,459 --> 01:18:57,713
? YES , JESUS LOVES ME ?

797
01:18:57,713 --> 01:19:1,217
? YES , JESUS LOVES ME ?

798
01:19:1,217 --> 01:19:5,555
? YES , JESUS LOVES ME ?

799
01:19:5,555 --> 01:19:8,558
? ? THE BIBLE- - ?

800
01:19:8,558 --> 01:19:11,060
WHO YOU SINGING TO , PRINCESS ?

801
01:19:11,561 --> 01:19:13,563
YOU SCARED JODY .

802
01:19:13,563 --> 01:19:16,566
JODY ?

803
01:19:16,566 --> 01:19:18,568
THERE 'S NO ONE HERE . SEE ?

804
01:19:18,568 --> 01:19:22,572
YOU SCARED HER . SHE WENT OUT THE WINDOW .

805
01:19:23,072 --> 01:19:24,574
SHE WENT OUT THE WINDOW ?

806
01:19:25,074 --> 01:19:29,078
I BETTER CHECK AND MAKE SURE SHE 'S NOT STILL THERE , HUH ?

807
01:19:40,706 --> 01:19:43,709
[ George ] THE HOUSE IS DOING THINGS .

808
01:19:43,709 --> 01:19:46,712
WINDOWS OPEN BY THEMSELVES .

809
01:19:46,712 --> 01:19:49,715
ROOMS FULL OF FLIES AT THE WRONG TIME OF YEAR .

810
01:19:50,216 --> 01:19:53,219
YOU SAW WHAT HAPPENED TO GREG 'S HAND .

811
01:19:53,219 --> 01:19:55,221
IT 'S CRAZY .

812
01:19:55,221 --> 01:19:59,225
AND LAST NIGHT THE FRONT DOOR WAS RIPPED OFF ITS HINGES ...

813
01:19:59,225 --> 01:20:1,227
FROM THE INSIDE .

814
01:20:1,227 --> 01:20:5,731
OF COURSE . IT 'S RIGHT HERE ; ITS HISTORY .

815
01:20:5,731 --> 01:20:7,733
JOHN KETCHUM .

816
01:20:7,733 --> 01:20:10,236
[ Jeff ] SO ?

817
01:20:10,236 --> 01:20:14,240
[ Carolyn ] THEY RAN HIM OUT OF SALEM FOR BEING A WITCH .

818
01:20:15,241 --> 01:20:19,245
HE BUILT HIS HOUSE EXACTLY WHERE YOU 'RE LIVING .

819
01:20:19,745 --> 01:20:23,249
YOU 'RE LIVING ON SOME SORT OF SPECIAL GROUND .

820
01:20:23,249 --> 01:20:25,251
DEVIL WORSHIP .

821
01:20:25,251 --> 01:20:27,253
DEATH .

822
01:20:27,253 --> 01:20:29,755
SACRIFICE .

823
01:20:30,256 --> 01:20:32,758
GEORGE ...

824
01:20:32,758 --> 01:20:35,261
THERE 'S ONE SIMPLE RULE .

825
01:20:35,261 --> 01:20:38,264
ENERGY CANNOT BE CREATED OR DESTROYED .

826
01:20:38,264 --> 01:20:40,266
IT CAN ONLY CHANGE FORMS .

827
01:20:40,266 --> 01:20:44,270
WILL YOU GET A GRIP ON YOURSELF ? YOU SOUND LIKE SOME KIND OF PSYCHO WEIRDO .

828
01:20:44,270 --> 01:20:48,774
JEFFREY , DON 'T BE SUCH A HARD-CORE RATIONALIST .

829
01:20:49,275 --> 01:20:52,278
EVERYTHING IN LIFE CANNOT BE EXPLAINED BY A SLIDE RULE .

830
01:20:52,278 --> 01:20:54,280
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR YOUR COSMIC VIEWS .

831
01:20:54,280 --> 01:20:56,282
NOW , DO ME A FAVOR : SHUT UP !

832
01:21:1,787 --> 01:21:5,791
CAN I MAKE A RATIONAL SUGGESTION , PLEASE ?

833
01:21:7,793 --> 01:21:11,797
SURE , MAN . ANYTHING .

834
01:21:11,797 --> 01:21:15,801
GO HOME , GET CLEANED UP ,

835
01:21:15,801 --> 01:21:18,304
TAKE KATHY OUT TO DINNER .

836
01:21:18,304 --> 01:21:21,307
CAROLYN AND I WILL BABY-SIT THE KIDS .

837
01:21:21,307 --> 01:21:23,309
YOU 'VE GOT TO GET AWAY FROM IT , GEORGE ,

838
01:21:23,309 --> 01:21:25,311
EVEN IF IT 'S FOR A COUPLE OF HOURS .

839
01:21:25,311 --> 01:21:28,814
WHEN YOU GET BACK , WE 'LL ADD IT ALL UP .

840
01:21:28,814 --> 01:21:31,317
WE 'LL TALK THIS THING THROUGH .

841
01:21:37,290 --> 01:21:39,792
OKAY .

842
01:21:39,792 --> 01:21:42,795
LET 'S GO HOME .

843
01:21:55,808 --> 01:21:57,310
I 'LL GO IN AND TALK TO KATHY .

844
01:21:57,810 --> 01:22:1,314
YOU ALL COME IN IN A COUPLE OF MINUTES . OKAY .

845
01:22:7,320 --> 01:22:9,322
HEY . HEY .

846
01:22:9,322 --> 01:22:11,324
HEY !

847
01:22:11,324 --> 01:22:13,826
HE TOLD US TO WAIT OUT HERE .

848
01:22:13,826 --> 01:22:18,331
JEFF ... I 'VE GOT TO SEE IT FOR MYSELF .

849
01:22:18,331 --> 01:22:21,334
I THOUGHT THAT PLACE GAVE YOU THE CREEPS . WHAT ?

850
01:22:21,334 --> 01:22:24,837
[ Sighs ]

851
01:22:24,837 --> 01:22:28,841
ARE THOSE VIBES EVER STRONG .

852
01:22:29,342 --> 01:22:32,845
IT REALLY PULLS ON YOU .

853
01:22:32,845 --> 01:22:36,349
I 'VE GOT TO SEE THE BASEMENT . THAT 'S WHERE IT 'S COMING FROM .

854
01:22:36,349 --> 01:22:39,852
I 'M VERY SENSITIVE ABOUT THESE THINGS ...

855
01:22:39,852 --> 01:22:42,355
AND I KNOW ABOUT THEM .

856
01:22:46,359 --> 01:22:48,861
COME ON . KNOCK IT OFF , WILL YOU ?

857
01:22:51,364 --> 01:22:53,866
WHAT I SAW WAS NOT A CAT .

858
01:22:56,369 --> 01:23:1,374
IT COULD HAVE CLIMBED UP THE IVY . IT 'S ALL OVER THE SIDE OF THE DAMNED HOUSE .

859
01:23:3,376 --> 01:23:6,379
LOOK , KATHY , I DON 'T HAVE ALL THE ANSWERS YET .

860
01:23:6,879 --> 01:23:9,882
WE 'VE GOT TO GET SOME PERSPECTIVE ON THIS THING .

861
01:23:9,882 --> 01:23:12,001
HUH ?

862
01:23:12,001 --> 01:23:16,505
COME ON , LET 'S TAKE JEFF 'S OFFER . PUT YOURSELF TOGETHER .

863
01:23:16,505 --> 01:23:21,010
LET 'S GET THE HELL AWAY FROM IT FOR A COUPLE HOURS .

864
01:23:21,010 --> 01:23:23,512
WE 'LL GET DRESSED .

865
01:23:24,513 --> 01:23:27,516
I JUST GOTTA CHECK THE FIRE FIRST .

866
01:23:36,742 --> 01:23:39,245
[ Creaks Open ] [ Carolyn Whispering ] DEMONS ARE SMART .

867
01:23:39,745 --> 01:23:43,749
THEY 'RE NOT JUST MONSTERS . THEY- -

868
01:23:43,749 --> 01:23:47,753
THEY THINK , JUST LIKE YOU AND I DO . [ Closes Door ]

869
01:23:48,254 --> 01:23:52,258
JUST IN REVERSE . YOU KNOW ? IT 'S A CLOSED SYSTEM .

870
01:23:52,258 --> 01:23:56,262
NOW YOU 'RE BEGINNING TO GIVE ME THE CREEPS .

871
01:23:58,764 --> 01:24:2,268
THERE WAS A TRIBE OF INDIANS CALLED THE SHINNECOCKS .

872
01:24:2,268 --> 01:24:6,222
THEY USED THIS LAND AS A SORT OF EXPOSURE PEN .

873
01:24:6,222 --> 01:24:8,224
[ Whining , Growling ]

874
01:24:8,224 --> 01:24:12,228
[ Carolyn ] THEY PUT ALL THE CRAZY PEOPLE HERE AND LEFT THEM TO DIE .

875
01:24:12,728 --> 01:24:16,232
[ Continues Whining ] MY GOD .

876
01:24:16,232 --> 01:24:18,234
THAT 'S WHERE IT IS .

877
01:24:18,484 --> 01:24:21,487
- WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT ? - [ Shudders ]

878
01:24:21,487 --> 01:24:24,490
[ Continues Whining ] [ Carolyn Whispering ] THERE ARE PEOPLE BURIED HERE .

879
01:24:29,245 --> 01:24:33,749
[ Harry Continues Whining ] [ Jeff ] EASY . EASY .

880
01:24:33,749 --> 01:24:36,252
EASY , HARRY .

881
01:24:36,252 --> 01:24:38,754
[ Continues Whining ]

882
01:24:38,754 --> 01:24:40,756
? [ " Jesus Loves Me " ]

883
01:24:40,756 --> 01:24:46,262
? [ Continues ]

884
01:24:50,266 --> 01:24:53,769
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING ?

885
01:24:53,769 --> 01:24:57,773
- [ Carolyn Grunting ] - WHAT IS THE MATTER WITH YOU ?

886
01:24:57,773 --> 01:25:0,776
DON 'T YOU UNDERSTAND ? IT HAS TO BE DONE .

887
01:25:0,776 --> 01:25:3,779
- THAT IS WHERE THE ROOM IS ! - WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING TO MY HOUSE ?

888
01:25:3,779 --> 01:25:5,781
GEORGE , I 'M SORRY . I DON 'T KNOW WHAT GOT INTO HER .

889
01:25:5,781 --> 01:25:8,901
[ Carolyn ] I 'M TRYING TO TELL HIM , THAT 'S WHERE IT IS .

890
01:25:19,962 --> 01:25:22,965
SHE 'S RIGHT .

891
01:25:22,965 --> 01:25:25,968
SHE 'S RIGHT . THERE IS SOMETHING HERE .

892
01:25:28,971 --> 01:25:30,973
GIVE ME THAT .

893
01:25:43,235 --> 01:25:47,039
[ Chipping Bricks Continues ]

894
01:25:49,041 --> 01:25:54,547
[ Chipping Continues ]

895
01:25:54,547 --> 01:25:56,549
WHAT 'S GOING ON ?

896
01:25:58,067 --> 01:26:0,553
HAVE YOU ALL GONE MAD ? GEORGE !

897
01:26:24,326 --> 01:26:28,330
THEY ... COME AND GO THROUGH HERE .

898
01:26:36,839 --> 01:26:39,842
[ Gasping ]

899
01:26:39,842 --> 01:26:42,344
[ Gruff Voice ] FIND THE WELL .

900
01:26:42,344 --> 01:26:44,847
[ Carolyn Grunting ]

901
01:26:44,847 --> 01:26:47,850
IT 'S THE PASSAGE ...

902
01:26:47,850 --> 01:26:49,852
TO HELL !

903
01:26:49,852 --> 01:26:54,356
[ Gasping ]

904
01:26:54,356 --> 01:26:56,859
COVER IT !

905
01:26:56,859 --> 01:27:0,863
[ Screaming ]

906
01:27:0,863 --> 01:27:5,367
[ Moaning ]

907
01:27:6,368 --> 01:27:9,321
[ Rings ]

908
01:27:11,373 --> 01:27:17,329
[ Continues Ringing ]

909
01:27:21,800 --> 01:27:27,756
[ Continues Ringing ]

910
01:27:31,760 --> 01:27:35,764
[ Continues Ringing ]

911
01:27:35,764 --> 01:27:39,268
[ Static ]

912
01:27:39,268 --> 01:27:42,771
[ Whispers ] HELLO . [ Line Disconnects ]

913
01:27:57,169 --> 01:27:59,071
[ Growling ]

914
01:27:59,171 --> 01:28:1,674
GEORGE , YOU HEARD THAT VOICE .

915
01:28:2,174 --> 01:28:4,677
YOU KNOW WHOSE VOICE THAT WAS ?

916
01:28:5,177 --> 01:28:8,130
YOU HEARD IT ! I KNOW YOU HEARD IT !

917
01:28:14,637 --> 01:28:18,140
WE HAVE TO DO SOMETHING , GEORGE .

918
01:28:18,140 --> 01:28:21,143
WE HAVE TO DO SOMETHING NOW .

919
01:28:25,648 --> 01:28:31,654
[ Police Radio Transmissions , Indistinct ]

920
01:28:34,657 --> 01:28:37,159
[ Gasps ]

921
01:29:5,437 --> 01:29:7,439
PEACE TO THIS HOUSE AND ALL WHO ENTER HERE .

922
01:29:7,439 --> 01:29:9,441
[ Kathy ] FORGIVE OUR SINS . PEACE TO THIS HOUSE ...

923
01:29:9,441 --> 01:29:11,944
AND ALL WHO ENTER HERE . AND SAVE US FROM ALL ILLNESS .

924
01:29:12,444 --> 01:29:14,446
GRANT THIS THROUGH JESUS CHRIST , OUR LORD .

925
01:29:23,756 --> 01:29:25,708
[ Softly ] WHAT 'S GOING ON ?

926
01:29:27,710 --> 01:29:31,663
[ Scoffs , Mutters ] WEIRD PEOPLE .

927
01:29:47,479 --> 01:29:50,482
BLESS THIS HOUSE AND ALL WHO ENTER HERE .

928
01:29:50,482 --> 01:29:52,484
BLESS THIS HOUSE- -

929
01:29:53,986 --> 01:29:55,988
WHAT- - WHAT 'S HAPPENING ?

930
01:29:55,988 --> 01:29:57,990
[ Cross Hits Floor ]

931
01:29:57,990 --> 01:29:59,992
[ Gasps ]

932
01:29:59,992 --> 01:30:2,494
[ Crying ]

933
01:30:2,494 --> 01:30:5,998
KATHY ? KATHY ?

934
01:30:7,132 --> 01:30:10,002
- KATHY ? - NO ! DON 'T TOUCH ME !

935
01:30:10,502 --> 01:30:15,507
[ Crying ] LEAVE ME ALONE , PLEASE .

936
01:30:15,507 --> 01:30:18,010
PLEASE ?

937
01:30:21,513 --> 01:30:25,517
[ Groaning , Crying ]

938
01:30:25,901 --> 01:30:31,406
[ Bell Tolling ]

939
01:30:34,409 --> 01:30:36,912
[ Bolen ] FATHER , SINCE I 'VE COME BACK FROM VIETNAM ,

940
01:30:36,912 --> 01:30:39,915
YOU 'VE BEEN A TREMENDOUS INFLUENCE IN MY LIFE .

941
01:30:39,915 --> 01:30:43,418
[ Tolling Continues ] I LOOK UP TO YOU . I RESPECT YOU . I ADMIRE YOU .

942
01:30:43,786 --> 01:30:46,288
AND WHAT IS YOUR POINT ?

943
01:30:46,789 --> 01:30:50,793
WELL , I BELIEVE THAT ... I KNOW ABOUT FEAR .

944
01:30:50,793 --> 01:30:54,797
I 'VE SEEN IT . I ... EXPERIENCED IT .

945
01:30:56,799 --> 01:31:0,302
RICHARD , I WISH YOU 'D MAKE YOUR POINT BECAUSE I 'VE GOT A LOT OF THINGS TO DO .

946
01:31:0,302 --> 01:31:5,557
MY POINT IS , FATHER , THAT I BELIEVE WE CREATE OUR OWN DEMONS IN OUR OWN MINDS .

947
01:31:8,060 --> 01:31:10,062
I 'M SORRY , FATHER .

948
01:31:33,085 --> 01:31:37,589
IN THE NAME OF THE FATHER , THE SON AND THE HOLY SPIRIT .

949
01:31:43,595 --> 01:31:46,098
LET US PRAY .

950
01:31:58,493 --> 01:32:1,997
FATHER ...

951
01:32:2,497 --> 01:32:5,000
BY THE POWER OF YOUR SPIRIT ,

952
01:32:5,500 --> 01:32:8,503
YOU HAVE FILLED THE HEARTS ...

953
01:32:9,004 --> 01:32:12,007
OF YOUR FAITHFUL PEOPLE ...

